            "review_title": "Review at Bánh Canh Cua Út Thảo",
            "review_text": "Justtravelled\nNew York City, New York50 contributions\n0\nCrab noodle soup, Crab noodle soup, crab noodle soup with a soda on the side.\nNov 2024 • Solo\nGot the Banh Can Cua (Crap noodle soup) here. One of my favorite dishes and glad I stopped by this place. Looks kind of like a tourist trap, but the pricing wasn't that bad considering you're close to Ben Thanh Market. Fast service. Will eat here again next time I'm back.\nInsider tip:\nSmall stall, can get busy during peak times, not many seats, could be seated with a stranger if you're solo.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten February 14, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
