            "review_text": "Bernard M\n4 contributions\n0\nNo, to flee\nDec 2024 • Couples\nToilet out of order.\nWe order 2 identical dishes (seaweed soup with crab claws); the waitress comes back a few minutes later to say that this dish is no longer available and offers us another soup that we accept. In the end, she brings us a single bowl; they say we expect a second... that never arrived.\nThe food is not bad, just ordinary. You can find better around Ben Thanh Market.\nTotally disgusted.\nRead more\nTranslated from French\nShow original\nWritten December 15, 2024",
